rice:Yellow_Orange_Leaf_Stripe a owl:NamedIndividual, rice:Symptom ;
    rdfs:label "water-soaked to yellow-orange stripe"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Stripe lesion on the leaf blade or tip, water-soaked at first and later yellow-orange; often starts at a wound. Kept apart from Yellow_Stripe, whose comment describes the downy mildew stripe."@en ;
    rice:affectsPlantPart rice:Leaf_Blade .

